{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/SteamDescriptionBannerTemplate.jpg?t=1752857611\" /></div><br>Sheep strapped to rockets and jetpacks star in this precision / rage platformer.  Boost through perilous terrain and traps to reach the goal in record time or just before everyone else.  Every sheep has dreamed of touching the stars, will you be the first?<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/777d7532c7fe032e3f10058baecb9eb7.avif?t=1752857611\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/MultiplayerMadness.gif?t=1752857611\" /></div><br>Precision / rage platformer featuring PvP multiplayer party-game modes. Challenge friends and open lobbies to rocket-powered sheep races.  Be the first to the end for points, utilize catchup mechanics, add crazy modifiers and more.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/3734cc859a977751a8ecae29288ac79c.avif?t=1752857611\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/ChallengingPrecision.gif?t=1752857611\" /></div><br>Tackle the single player story and challenges casually, or attempt to achieve S-Rank times in every level to unlock more cosmetics and other goodies. Campaign mode provides a great practice ground for game night as well!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/2f68100faeb741c3f096092397c4c181.avif?t=1752857611\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/extras/CustomizeSheep.gif?t=1752857611\" /></div><br>Customize your sheep with an assortment of rockets, jetpacks, silly hats, colors, and more to unlock.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURE LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rage / Precision platformer with escalating challenges<br></li><li> Multiplayer lobbies with friends or take your chances with open lobbies<br></li><li> Multiple difficulty modes to suit beginners and pros alike<br></li><li> Highly customizable multiplayer gameplay for everyone<br></li><li> Customizable cosmetics and unlockables<br></li><li> Challenge / Speedrun mode for the ones looking for maximum rage<br></li><li> Simple to learn, difficult to master</li></ul><br>(Always looking for feedback, join the Discord Server or SubReddit to share)","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520580?t=1752857611","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/a0a5ed5a994df698e9fb778385bb1ce78e0c85e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752857611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/1fa62cbed48c643e35481e97427ae092a40cbe91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752857611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520580/1fa62cbed48c643e35481e97427ae092a40cbe91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752857611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","